H.264 CABAC normative table attribution
========================================

The CABAC arithmetic rules, slice-data binarizations, context derivations, and
fixed numeric probability tables in this directory implement ITU-T
Recommendation H.264 (08/2024), clauses 7.3.3, 7.3.5, 9.3.1, 9.3.3, and
Tables 9-11 through 9-43, 9-44, and 9-45. The current slice-data layer is
limited to progressive 4:2:0 syntax and the context range 0 through 459.

The numeric tables and arithmetic behavior were cross-checked against:

  Cisco OpenH264
  https://github.com/cisco/openh264
  codec/common/src/common_tables.cpp
  codec/decoder/core/src/cabac_decoder.cpp
  codec/decoder/core/src/parse_mb_syn_cabac.cpp
  codec/decoder/core/inc/wels_common_basis.h

